- sentencepiece (Google): Apache License 2.0
- kissfft: BSD 3-Clause License
- utf8proc: MIT License
- PortAudio: MIT License

libopus (Xiph.Org Foundation and contributors), https://opus-codec.org
BSD 3-Clause License.

